WEBVTT

00:28:29.121 --> 00:28:32.496
But it turns out that when you
go into detail, people,

00:28:33.329 --> 00:28:35.288
those studies that you have,

00:28:36.079 --> 00:28:40.288
it's not that everybody is behaving
like the average of the study.

00:28:40.329 --> 00:28:45.496
That's simply false. There are different
subgroups were doing different things.

00:28:45.871 --> 00:28:51.246
And and life turns out to be much more
complicated than if you were just trying

00:28:51.246 --> 00:28:54.621
to explain the average. So the necessity

00:28:54.621 --> 00:28:57.954
for studying individual differences is,

00:28:58.246 --> 00:29:02.288
I think the most important thing that
I have rethought and, you know,